/semantics></math>. Khi đó, tiếp tuyến là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>31</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> (thích hợp).</li></ul>\n\t\t\tVậy có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> tiếp tuyến thỏa mãn yêu cầu bài toán là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>,  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>31</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vì tiếp tuyến vuông góc với đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó,\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalig